    [Test][Misc] Consolidate Mooncake transfer engine unit tests into test class (#19992)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    This pull request consolidates the standalone unit tests for the
    Mooncake transfer engine into the `test_mooncake_transfer_engine.py`
    test class. It removes the redundant test file and integrates the test
    cases as methods within the existing test class structure.
    
    Feedback was provided regarding a brittle assertion on a hardcoded slice
    of `mock_calls` in `test_unregister_and_reregister_registered_buffers`.
    It is recommended to use `assert_has_calls` for a more robust and
    maintainable assertion.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    The patch reorganizes existing unit tests into the main test suite
    class.
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/544f182d9f0c9bfe8bd7645525951d5e3692a542
    
    Signed-off-by: zhichao <linzhichao2@huawei.com>

